{"id":"1dd8b3118783dcb5","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-regular-word-pumping.md","title":"73-thm-regular-word-pumping — regular word pumping","display":"73-thm-regular-word-pumping — regular word pumping","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-regular-word-pumping","display":"73-thm-regular-word-pumping — regular word pumping","depends_on":["[[73-df-regular-language-notation]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]"],"aliases":["73-thm-regular-word-pumping","73-theorem-1.4"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-regular-word-pumping"},{"key":"display","html":"73-thm-regular-word-pumping — regular word pumping"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a2d140de13ec8897\" href=\"?note=a2d140de13ec8897\" title=\"73-df-regular-language-notation\">73-df-regular-language-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e48ecbf40a3c92b6\" href=\"?note=e48ecbf40a3c92b6\" title=\"73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping\">73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-regular-word-pumping</span><span>73-theorem-1.4</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a2d140de13ec8897\" href=\"?note=a2d140de13ec8897\" title=\"73-df-regular-language-notation\">73-df-regular-language-notation</a>；词连接、幂与长度采用固定词运算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.4}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in L\\;\\bigl(|w|\\ge p\\to\n\\exists x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=xyz\\land|xy|\\le p\\land|y|\\ge1\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;xy^iz\\in L)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.4}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in L\\;\\bigl(|w|\\ge p\\to\n\\exists x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=xyz\\land|xy|\\le p\\land|y|\\ge1\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;xy^iz\\in L)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-regular-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a2d140de13ec8897","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regular-language-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping","status":"resolved","id":"e48ecbf40a3c92b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-regular-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a2d140de13ec8897","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}$，见 [[73-df-regular-language-notation]]；词连接、幂与长度采用固定词运算。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.4}\\vdash\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\forall w\\in L\\;\\bigl(|w|\\ge p\\to\n\\exists x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(w=xyz\\land|xy|\\le p\\land|y|\\ge1\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;xy^iz\\in L)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1067,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["a2d140de13ec8897","0a6da8c909717780","e48ecbf40a3c92b6"]}